{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576690/extras/lastlaugh7diffendl.png?t=1741836161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Laugh</strong> is a horror game with <strong>7 different endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORY:</strong><br>The game follows three mischievous teenagers who enjoy hanging out, laughing, and playing games at one of their friends' houses. But then...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576690/extras/giff1.gif?t=1741836161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Retro Horror Experience</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a horror atmosphere with <strong>PS1-style graphics</strong> and <strong>pixel art visuals</strong> that enhance the eerie feeling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Uncover all <strong>7 different endings</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcfa <strong>Dynamic Menu Changes</strong> \u2013 The <strong>main menu evolves</strong> based on the endings you've unlocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Auto-Save Feature</strong> \u2013 Your progress is automatically saved, allowing you to <strong>continue and explore different endings</strong> without starting over!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576690?t=1741836161","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576690?t=1741836161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576690/e5f83042b2ecccf7038dc5545ce9f156cbef5071/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741836161","capsul